WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.730
Right, let's give this car a glow-up. It takes about a minute, I promise.

2
00:00:06.893 --> 00:00:14.783
Open Photo Studio from the Stock menu, and pick your car. Its photos line up along the top, with the main one first.

3
00:00:15.899 --> 00:00:24.099
Photo a bit gloomy? Light and turn brightens it up, adds a touch of contrast, and can even straighten a wonky picture.

4
00:00:26.673 --> 00:00:33.623
Banner pops Just Arrived, Reduced, Low Miles or a price strip across the photo. Very eye-catching.

5
00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:40.860
Want the number plate hidden? Drag a box over it and blur it, or pop your name on it instead.

6
00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:48.967
Save it as a new photo. Your original stays put, just in case.

7
00:00:50.086 --> 00:00:56.536
Then Square post makes a picture with the price and your name on it, ready for Facebook and Instagram.

8
00:00:57.651 --> 00:01:02.271
And that's it! Press Help on any screen whenever you want me to show you again.
